WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:07.112
When your surveyor spends half the week driving out to two-bed flats, new enquiries sit waiting in the office.

2
00:00:08.912 --> 00:00:14.070
With reloops video surveys, your team can survey and price moves in hours, not days.

3
00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:22.760
Pick the right survey for every home: customers in smaller flats film on their phone with no app to download.

4
00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:28.751
Book a guided video call for mid-sized houses, and save road visits for your biggest moves.

5
00:00:30.551 --> 00:00:36.301
Room clips from the lounge, kitchen, and bedrooms turn into a clear room-by-room inventory.

6
00:00:37.101 --> 00:00:41.700
You get the total volume in both cubic feet and cubic metres, ready for your estimator.

7
00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:53.550
Your surveyor stays in charge — replay any clip, note awkward stairs or parking permits, add fragile packing, and adjust quantities.

8
00:00:55.350 --> 00:01:02.168
If someone hasn't filmed yet, polite reminders go out at twenty-four and seventy-two hours, followed by an office call task.

9
00:01:04.725 --> 00:01:09.414
Quote in hours, not days. Visit reloops.co to book a fifteen-minute call.
